{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 10, :comments ["<b>And he shall make atonement once a year.</b> On the tenth of the seventh month." "And the meaning of the atonements is by the blood of the bull and the blood of the goat, and this is an obligation every year, and there is no need to mention the blood of the bull of the anointed one or of the congregation when they sin, for they do not occur regularly but only rarely."], :book :exodus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 30, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:39:18.268930679Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}